{"createdAt":"2026-10-03T07:01:41.260Z","data":{"_slug":"melt-interface-technologies","body":[{"_key":"p3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"span","marks":["p0"],"text":"Diver-X"},{"_key":"p2","_type":"span","text":"が社名変更してMelt Interface Technologiesになりました"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"link","href":"/ja/works/diver-x/"}],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"p5","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p4","_type":"span","text":"何をしてるの"}],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pa","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p6","_type":"span","text":"基本的な事業内容は "},{"_key":"p8","_type":"span","marks":["p7"],"text":"Diver-X"},{"_key":"p9","_type":"span","text":"と同じですが、より広い、HIDなどにとどまらない、ひとと機械をつなぐインターフェースをつくる会社になりました。"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"p7","_type":"link","href":"/ja/works/diver-x/"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pd","_type":"link_card","description":"Melt Interface Technologiesは、人間とコンピュータの“接点”にこそ、体験と生産性を左右する大きな可能性が宿ると考えています。私たちは、人間の力を最大限に引き出す革新的なインターフェースを創り続けます。","fetchedAt":"2026-10-03T14:16:12.062Z","id":"https://melt-interface-technologies.com/","image":"../../media/b72bb1b3e1ab6d52c98bf3049b5b3da74a15c877ae5ab0da259efd8c2f15f35a.png","metadataUrl":"https://melt-interface-technologies.com/","siteName":"Melt Interface Technologies Inc.","title":"Melt Interface Technologies Inc.","unavailable":false},{"_key":"ph","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pf","_type":"span","marks":["pe"],"text":"大学"},{"_key":"pg","_type":"span","text":"に通いながらアルバイトとして、お手伝いしています。"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"pe","_type":"link","href":"/ja/works/keio/"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pj","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pi","_type":"span","text":"関わっているプロダクト"}],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"pn","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pk","_type":"span","text":"引き続き、Melt Interfaceブランドのソフトウェアを開発しています。Melt Mouseの制御に使うMelt Studioなどが中心です。\n"},{"_key":"pm","_type":"span","marks":["pl"],"text":"https://www.melt-interface.com/melt-mouse"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"pl","_type":"link","href":"https://www.melt-interface.com/melt-mouse"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"54nha93xw","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"mstqa0why","_type":"span","text":"First, Melt Studio. Tokumaru, who leads its software development, is currently building out the animations. When you move between settings screens, a smooth animation plays — small touches like these are what make the app easy to follow and genuinely pleasant to use. He's refining it day by day."}],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"fktbymjj7","_type":"poc_markdown","body":"<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/W4UMyVppLrw\" width=\"315\" height=\"560\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>"}],"date_precision":"month","description":"MIT(Melt Interface Technologies)でソフトウェア開発に従事しています","emoji":"💼","hidden_from_listing":0,"is_work_in_progress":0,"properties":{},"published_updated_at":"2026-10-06T01:31:33.491Z","title":"Melt Interface Technologies"},"id":"01M409338CBG3RXRJSHN6CHZ2A","locale":"ja","publishedAt":"2026-01-27T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"melt-interface-technologies","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9H67RHN3BBE1KCCSPBEF","label":"制作物","locale":"ja","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"works","translationGroup":"01M40J9GWCNE9P1KA36B33P9DG"}],"tag":[{"id":"01M40J9KFDN19JEFZ5XJQX8YVD","label":"Work","locale":"ja","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"work","translationGroup":"01M40J9K78GHC9M6B4KNK1VX28"}]},"translationGroup":"01M409338CBG3RXRJSHN6CHZ2A"}
